{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats, Dogs, and\u2026 the Grim Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The struggle of a cat and a dog to return from death begins now. Guard your home with traps, unleash chaos in your rival\u2019s, and remember to fix up your own house before time runs out. Sharpen your mind, trust your speed, and put those paws to work to snatch the second chance the Grim\u00a0 Reaper offers in this 1v1 arena action-strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two neighbors\u2014a cat and a dog\u2014have hated each other for years while living on the same street. One day, as they\u2019re fighting in the yard, lightning \u201caccidentally\u201d strikes them both and their lives end\u2026 and they find themselves before the Grim Reaper! But this isn\u2019t the end\u2014Azrael gives them one last chance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cMake your owner happy by sunset. The winner lives. The loser will be forgotten forever.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Tactics, Tame the Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your home with traps, turn your rival\u2019s house upside down, or focus on repairing your own. What you do and when you do it is entirely your decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/f02b79929d62d3cd6f566d879e79d67b.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1560 height=109 /></span>Lay traps in your own house and make your enemy\u2019s job harder. With smartly placed traps and creative defenses make it harder to target your stuff and force your rival to waste precious time.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/2daebd0b1c011e313f19d3d1d75ed26c.poster.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/2daebd0b1c011e313f19d3d1d75ed26c.webm?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/2daebd0b1c011e313f19d3d1d75ed26c.mp4?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/a52ec80bd78087fb5009a975493cd8e5.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tools and paws, create absolute mayhem. Shatter glasses, topple the TV, smear mud across the floors\u2014make the owner lose their mind! But beware: your rival\u2019s plotting the same for you. plotting the same for you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/8bfc153a9cdee4565c93af60f6bfce99.poster.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/8bfc153a9cdee4565c93af60f6bfce99.webm?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/8bfc153a9cdee4565c93af60f6bfce99.mp4?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/d05ac2eaa3902d1ab230c79e31257576.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash back and fix every mess! Race the clock to keep your place clean and tidy so you can make your owner happy. \u00a0 When your owner returns, make sure you\u2019re the one smiling!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/25f927effababfa6062ec407d64a7cca.poster.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/25f927effababfa6062ec407d64a7cca.webm?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/25f927effababfa6062ec407d64a7cca.mp4?t=1773166547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/9b4c690b1cd2ee75041147f41552ebde.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the timer hits zero, whoever\u2019s owner is angry goes to their appointment with the Grim Reaper.This is a battle of intellect, speed, and strategy. You may be adorable, but to win you\u2019ll have to be ruthless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/5e0832e5acac712424955df83c885035.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1441 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/extras/06d005a77a36f94b90f3925d57db7099.avif?t=1773166547\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-of-a-Kind Competition:</strong> A comedic cocktail of strategy, speed, and sabotage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smashable, Dynamic World:</strong> Wreck every corner of the house. Smash cups like a cat, or decorate the floor with muddy pawprints like a dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Tactics and Tools:</strong> Use different traps to outsmart your rival in a new way every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming but Lethal!:\u00a0</strong>Cats and dogs have never been this adorable\u2014and this merciless.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041340?t=1773166547","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/8e35cefc3763515f827512fd6ebcf018840b5713/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773166547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/e22aafa09ff1878a730e736b2febbb35bc839f6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773166547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041340/e22aafa09ff1878a730e736b2febbb35bc839f6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773166547","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cats, Dogs, and\u2026 the Grim Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The struggle of a cat and a dog to return from death begins now. Guard your home with traps, unleash chaos in your rival\u2019s, and remember to fix up your own house before time runs out. Sharpen your mind, trust your speed, and put those paws to work to snatch the second chance the Grim\u00a0 Reaper offers in this 1v1 arena action-strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two neighbors\u2014a cat and a dog\u2014have hated each other for years while living on the same street. One day, as they\u2019re fighting in the yard, lightning \u201caccidentally\u201d strikes 